  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math><mn>3</mn></math> students are <math><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>C</mi></math> and their probability of solving problems is <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> respectively.<br /><math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></math><br />Probability of the problem is being solved,&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>S</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></msup><mo>&#8745;</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></msup><mo>&#8745;</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mi>C</mi></msup><mo>)</mo></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><msup><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>&#945;</mi></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>S</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
  }
